1.0 Case Profile and Introduction

This document presents a formal case study of the insolvency proceedings of Bharat Papers Limited. An analysis of this case provides significant insights for legal and financial professionals, illuminating the procedural pathway from the initiation of a Corporate Insolvency Resolution Process (CIRP) to its eventual culmination in liquidation under the Indian insolvency framework. By examining the key stages, appointed…";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1763443357;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:25:"rbz_reports:cd_ibc_status";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:8964;s:9:"timestamp";i:1763443357;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1763443621;}s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:7:"creator";s:0:"";s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1763443357;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:25:"rbz_reports:cd_ibc_status";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:8964;s:9:"timestamp";i:1763443357;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}